ps://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"You basically summarised word-by-word what I was thinking when I \"casually\" made that suggestion. It was not truly \"casual\" because I have been thinking about it for quite a while, but...\r\n\r\nThere's also one more reason that's not mentioned among @Ivorforce's: I don't think the **History** dock deserves that much vertical space to be displayed. While the history can go pretty far back in time, most users will only really be interested in the top-most options in the list (the most recent **EditorUndoRedo** actions).\r\n\r\nAnyway, that's why I approve from an usability standpoint.\r\n\r\nHowever, let's be wary of a few considerations before getting this merged:\r\n- This will ruin some users' workflow, which is absolutely inevitable for any change of this kind.\r\n\t- We should merge this sooner than later, evaluate the feedback, and see if it matches our reasoning and expectations.\r\n\t- It is fairly intuitive for the user to move the **History** dock back where it used to be after this PR, if absolutely desired.\r\n- You can easily debate that, for several reasons, the History dock could be hidden by default, instead.\r\n\t- I must heavily note that doing this would serve little to no purpose for the time being, if not just to declutter the editor. There must be a good reason to do so (for example, space for a new dock in its place).\r\n\t- [Since its introduction](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/65012), the original author [does not have a particular fondness](https://chat.godotengine.org/channel/editor-design?msg=NAR3SyvM32Nn5ysvY) of the **History** dock (😭)\r\n\t- Let's remember that no one is arguing to _remove_ the **History** dock. This is not an option; the **History** dock has proven to 